EA publishes no clean per-weapon render set: ea.com has no weapons page
(`/games/apex-legends/about/weapons`, `/apex-legends/weapons` and
`/apex-legends/about` are 404s), the patch notes show season art and
screenshots, and the event pages show skinned guns. Two guns have no usable
EA picture (2026-10-21); the app shows the class symbol for them until the
owner trains the weapon from his own screen, and his crop then becomes the
row's picture (D122 section 5):

- **L-STAR EMG** (group `lmgs`): a Care Package gun, so the Season 29 and 30
