  another gun's icon (the Devotion in the Breach notes, the Wingman in the
  28-1 notes), so no clean crop exists.
- **Kraber .50-Cal Sniper** (group `sniper_rifles`): a Care Package gun; no
  Designer's Notes chart searched (27-1, 28-0, 28-1, 29-0, 29-1, 30-0, 30-1)
